<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Public Storage lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Public Storage lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securites said analyst Mary Hogan downgraded Public Storage Inc to buy from strong buy due to the stock's valuation.</p>
<p>-- said stock has posted a 44 percent total return since last August.</p>
<p>-- shares were off 2/16 to 30-1/16.</p>
</text>
